# Frequency conversion between kilohertz and megahertz

Verifies direct conversion between kilohertz and megahertz in both directions. Kilohertz converts to the coarser unit through decimal promotion, while megahertz converts to kilohertz with an integer scale.

>>> source
const forward_whole: int = 1khz
print(forward_whole->to(mhz))
const forward_fractional: decimal = 1.5khz
print(forward_fractional->to(mhz))
const backward_whole: int = 1mhz
print(backward_whole->to(khz))
const backward_fractional: decimal = 1.5mhz
print(backward_fractional->to(khz))

<<< stdout
0.001mhz
0.0015mhz
1000khz
1500.0khz

<<< stderr
